{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16441","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第二拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第二拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马上将余向绝域，厌生求死死不得。\n戎羯腥膻岂是人，豺狼喜怒难姑息。\n行尽天山足霜霰，风土萧条近胡国。\n万里重阴鸟不飞，寒沙莽莽无南北。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}